#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
YouTube -> Slides extractor for NVIDIA DGX Spark (GB10).

Adapted from Prof. Alberto Muñoz's Jupyter notebook. The scientific pipeline is
kept intact: local download, Pass A content-mask discovery, Pass B GPU/NVDEC
segmentation, Pass C native-resolution sharpest-frame capture, provenance stamp,
metadata JSON, and PDF assembly.

This file is intentionally independent from FastAPI so every extraction runs in
an isolated subprocess. It writes machine-readable progress to --status-file.
"""
